# WEB MASS SCAN 🔍

> **High-Performance Web Mass Scanner**  
> *Developed by Tapr0baneSec*

`WEB MASS SCAN` is an asynchronous, multi-threaded CLI tool designed for fast web reconnaissance and basic security posture auditing.

