## ✨ Features

* **Asynchronous & Multi-threaded Engine:** Fast target scanning.
* **WAF & Firewall Detection:** Identifies web application firewalls.
* **Security Header Analysis:** Checks for missing security headers (CORS, CSP, etc.).
* **Basic Port & SSL/TLS Auditing:** Quick identification of open management ports.

---

## 🚀 Installation & Usage

### Prerequisites
* Python 3.8+

### Setup
```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/YourUsername/web-mass-scan.git](https://github.com/YourUsername/web-mass-scan.git)

# Navigate to directory
cd web-mass-scan

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run the tool
python main.py
```

